{"question": "Is the US military getting ready for Cuba?", "country": "CU", "style": "maproom", "voice_speed": 0.95, "gap": 0.36, "hook": true, "hook_lines": ["US EYES TROOPS FOR CUBA", "Army: 90 to 120 days"], "cover": ["US ARMY.", "CUBA.", "90 DAYS?"], "region": "CUBA / CARIBBEAN", "places": {"HAVANA": {"id": "HAVANA", "name": "Havana", "lat": 23.11, "lon": -82.37}, "KEYWEST": {"id": "KEYWEST", "name": "Key West", "lat": 24.56, "lon": -81.78}, "UN": {"id": "UN", "name": "UN, New York", "lat": 40.75, "lon": -73.97}, "CARIB": {"id": "CARIB", "name": "Caribbean Sea", "lat": 15.0, "lon": -75.0}, "WASHINGTON": {"id": "WASHINGTON", "name": "Washington", "lat": 38.9, "lon": -77.04}, "MIAMI": {"id": "MIAMI", "name": "SOUTHCOM, Miami", "lat": 25.82, "lon": -80.35}}, "lines": [{"text": "The US Army Reserve is checking six kinds of units that could be needed within 90 to 120 days.", "src": [0], "context": false, "note": "CBS News, 25 Sep 2026", "scene": {"type": "pin", "place": "MIAMI", "head": "6 unit types", "notes": ["for Southern Command", "90 to 120 days"], "span": 11}}, {"text": "CBS News says no unit has been given deployment orders.", "src": [0], "context": false, "note": "CBS News, 25 Sep 2026", "scene": {"type": "statement", "lines": ["Deployment orders:", "none. So far."], "flag": "US"}}, {"text": "The target region is Cuba. And it did not start this week.", "src": [0], "context": false, "note": "CBS News, 25 Sep 2026", "scene": {"type": "pin", "place": "HAVANA", "head": "Cuba", "notes": ["Southern Command area"], "span": 9}}, {"text": "In March, Trump told reporters: Cuba's going to be next.", "src": [0], "context": false, "note": "CBS News, 25 Sep 2026", "scene": {"type": "flow", "from": "WASHINGTON", "to": ["HAVANA"], "label": "Trump, March 2026"}}, {"text": "American forces then mapped the seafloor and the sea approaches around the island.", "src": [0], "context": false, "note": "CBS News, 25 Sep 2026", "scene": {"type": "route", "from": "KEYWEST", "to": "HAVANA", "label": "Seafloor recon", "note": "maritime approaches"}}, {"text": "In July, planners studied an air assault by thousands of soldiers from the 101st Airborne.", "src": [0], "context": false, "note": "CBS News, 25 Sep 2026", "scene": {"type": "flight", "from": {"lat": 36.66, "lon": -87.47}, "to": "HAVANA", "label": "101st Airborne option", "sub": "planning, July 2026"}}, {"text": "CBS counts 70 US strikes in the Caribbean and eastern Pacific, killing more than 230 people.", "src": [0], "context": false, "note": "CBS News, 25 Sep 2026", "scene": {"type": "pin", "place": "CARIB", "head": "70 strikes", "notes": ["230+ killed", "CBS News count"], "span": 13}}, {"text": "Then, on Tuesday, Trump took the stage at the United Nations.", "src": [1], "context": false, "note": "Forbes, 22 Sep 2026", "scene": {"type": "pin", "place": "UN", "head": "UN, 22 Sep", "notes": ["General Assembly"], "span": 9}}, {"text": "He called Cuba an absolutely failed state, and said: it will fall.", "src": [1], "context": false, "note": "Forbes, 22 Sep 2026", "scene": {"type": "quote", "quote": "failing like never before, and it will fall", "who": "Donald Trump, UN, 22 Sep", "flag": "US"}}, {"text": "Cuba's delegation stood up and walked out.", "src": [0, 1], "context": false, "note": "CBS News / Forbes", "scene": {"type": "walkout", "label": "Cuba's delegation walks out", "count": 4}}, {"text": "Trump says he won't allow a haven for foreign adversaries on America's doorstep.", "src": [1], "context": false, "note": "Forbes, 22 Sep 2026", "scene": {"type": "route", "from": "HAVANA", "to": "KEYWEST", "label": "\"our own doorstep\"", "note": "Trump, UN"}}, {"text": "In Havana, President Miguel Díaz-Canel has vowed to counter any US attack.", "src": [0], "context": false, "note": "CBS News, 25 Sep 2026", "scene": {"type": "pin", "place": "HAVANA", "head": "Díaz-Canel", "notes": ["vows to counter", "any US attack"], "span": 9}}, {"text": "Washington says it wants fundamental change on the island.", "src": [0], "context": false, "note": "CBS News, 25 Sep 2026", "scene": {"type": "statement", "lines": ["US goal:", "fundamental change."], "flag": "CU"}}, {"text": "Six unit types. Ninety days at the earliest. Is Cuba next?", "src": [0], "context": false, "note": "CBS News, 25 Sep 2026", "scene": {"type": "wide"}}], "sources": [{"n": 0, "outlet": "CBS News", "title": "U.S. military lays groundwork for potential action around Cuba", "url": "https://www.cbsnews.com/news/u-s-groundwork-potential-action-cuba-trump/"}, {"n": 1, "outlet": "Forbes", "title": "Trump Says Cuba Is 'Failing' And 'Will Fall' At UN, Prompting Delegation Walk-Out", "url": "https://www.forbes.com/sites/saradorn/2026/09/22/cuba-delegation-walks-out-when-trump-calls-it-an-absolutely-failed-state-at-un/"}], "caption": "CBS News reports the US Army Reserve is checking which units could be needed near Cuba within 90 to 120 days. No orders yet. Three days ago Trump told the UN Cuba will fall, and Cuba's delegation walked out. Is Cuba next?", "hashtags": ["cuba", "usmilitary", "trump", "havana", "outpost"]}